@startuml 07_estado_sesion
title Diagrama de Estado - Clase Session (Sesion)
skinparam shadowing false

state Started : Iniciada
state Authenticating : Autenticando (tarjeta)
state Authenticating : do / ValidateCard (Sucursal)
state Validating : Validando (PIN)
state Validating : do / ValidatePin (Red Central)
state Operating : Operando
state Closing : Cerrando
state Closing : do / GenerateReceipt (si el cliente lo pide)
state Closed : Cerrada

[*] --> Started
Started --> Authenticating : InsertCard(number, expirationDate)
Authenticating --> Validating : [tarjeta válida]
Authenticating --> Closing : [tarjeta bloqueada o vencida]
Validating --> Operating : Authenticate(pin) [PIN correcto]
Validating --> Validating : Authenticate(pin) [PIN incorrecto e intentos < 3]
Validating --> Closing : Authenticate(pin) [PIN incorrecto e intentos = 3] / BlockCard
Validating --> Closing : Finish() [el cliente cancela]
Operating --> Operating : Execute(operation) [operación exitosa] / RegisterOperation
Operating --> Closing : Finish()
Closing --> Closed : Close() / ReturnCard, RemoveAuthenticationData
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
